  (text "NOTA 1: Pinout U1 verificado no datasheet oficial Ebyte E73-2G4M04S1A (nRF52810):"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "26ba08db-82f0-488c-8816-e364f1350b6f")
  )
  (text "  https://www.cdebyte.com/products/E73-2G4M04S1A/2 -> VCC=pad16, GND=pads 0/1/2/15/42/43,"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4940d8a0-2206-4ba9-9114-25188f233aa2")
  )
  (text "  SWDCLK=pad37, SWDIO=pad38, P0.21/RST=pad36. A tabela de pads em docs/pesquisa_modulo_ble.md"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ba687973-f853-4ce5-9a08-e35a85a2094b")
  )
  (text "  diverge (cita SWD em pads 40/41 e RST no pad 33); prevalece o datasheet oficial."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 205.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9704bca3-67fb-449d-b1fd-913e687d7318")
  )
  (text "NOTA 2: DEC1/DEC2/DEC3/DEC4/DCC sem conexao: desacoplo e DC/DC internos ao modulo;"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 210.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a04f399a-bc4a-4a9b-948b-20d5116bcd54")
  )
  (text "  datasheet do modulo nao exige componente externo (BOM_smartbadge_v2 nao lista nenhum)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 215.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "857509b3-4ef5-4cc0-94a3-1c7429b9ff7e")
  )
  (text "NOTA 3: GPIOs P0.02-P0.31, P0.18 e P0.21/RST nao usados pelo firmware -> NC explicito."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 220.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e38d075c-9d9d-4c39-9f65-ef10d590399e")
  )
  (text "NOTA 4: Layout: keep-out de cobre sob a antena PCB integrada do modulo (y < -8,85 mm do"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6e685e1a-5928-498d-bd03-9648eab42142")
  )
  (text "  footprint RF_Module:E73-2G4M04S); ferrite SHLD1 entre BT1 e a bobina NFC TAG1; PCB 2"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 231.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6b8b70af-0273-4410-a357-61a4c3de8a8c")
  )
  (text "  camadas 0,8 mm, plano GND contiguo. Antena interna: nenhuma rede Pi externa."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "388b09b8-6867-4ddd-ae51-f1596752a3ac")
  )
  (text "NOTA 5: ANATEL: item aberto (modulo possui FCC/CE/TELEC/SRRC/KC/NCC). Alimentacao CR2032"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8242bf50-ca55-4564-92a8-1a6ff1dfa72b")
  )
  (text "  3,0V -> 2,0V direto em VCC (modulo aceita 1,8-3,6V, sem LDO interno)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 31.75 246.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "69b158fa-c80a-47db-a12b-081871b00972")
  )
  (text "NOTA 6: libs/nibas_wristband.kicad_sym (fonte) tem sintaxe rejeitada pelo parser de"
